 "馆陶县潮磊轴承制造有限责任公司（简称潮磊轴承），26 年制造基因，3000㎡ 标准化厂房，200 台磨床 / 超精 / 合套设备，日产 40 万套稳定交付。产品远销印度、巴基斯坦、欧洲、迪拜，为全球客户提供可靠传动解决方案。": "Guantao Chaolei Bearing Manufacturing Co., Ltd. (Chaolei Bearings) — 26 years of manufacturing DNA, 3,000 m² standardized plant, 200 grinders / superfinishers / assembly testers, 400k units/day stable delivery, exported to India, Pakistan, Europe and Dubai.",
 "馆陶县潮磊轴承制造有限责任公司（简称潮磊轴承），从一颗 608 做起，成长为覆盖 15+ 型号的深沟球轴承专业制造商。以下为工厂核心规模数据。": "Guantao Chaolei Bearing Manufacturing Co., Ltd. (Chaolei Bearings) grew from a single 608 into a professional deep groove ball bearing maker covering 15+ models. Key factory scale data below.",
 "潮磊608微型轴承广泛应用于玩具、电动工具、小家电电机、滑板健身器材、汽车部件与机器人。26年源头工厂直供，按工况定制，出口印度、巴基斯坦、欧洲、迪拜。": "Chaolei 608 miniature bearings are widely used in toys, power tools, small appliance motors, skateboards/fitness gear, automotive parts and robots. 26-year source factory with direct supply, custom by working conditions, exported to India, Pakistan, Europe and Dubai.",
 "潮磊轴承产品中心：608系列微型深沟球轴承（608ZZ/608-2RS/开放式），轴承钢GCr15、碳钢、不锈钢304可选，内径8mm/外径22mm/厚度7mm，共15+型号。支持非标定制，7天出样。": "Chaolei Products: 608 series miniature deep groove ball bearings (608ZZ/608-2RS/open), bearing steel GCr15, carbon steel or 304 stainless, ID 8mm / OD 22mm / width 7mm, 15+ models. Custom work supported; samples in 7 days.",
 "潮磊轴承制造能力：3000㎡工厂，磨床100台、超精机50台、合套仪50台，日产微型深沟球轴承40万套。磨削-超精-合套全流程自主管控，确保608系列品质稳定，支持定制。": "Chaolei manufacturing capacity: 3,000 m² plant, 100 grinders, 50 superfinishers, 50 assembly testers, 400k miniature DGBB per day. Full in-house grinding-superfinishing-assembly control ensures stable 608 quality; custom supported.",
