 "联系潮磊轴承（馆陶县潮磊轴承制造有限责任公司）：微型深沟球轴承源头工厂，提供608系列轴承报价、免费样品与定制方案，服务玩具、电动工具、小家电电机客户。": "Contact Chaolei Bearings (Guantao Chaolei Bearing Manufacturing Co., Ltd.): miniature DGBB source factory offering 608-series quotes, free samples and custom solutions for toys, power tools and small appliance motors.",
 "馆陶县潮磊轴承制造有限责任公司（潮磊轴承）轴承制造业务始于2000年（以加工户起步），品牌主体于2023年9月注册成立，扎根河北馆陶县——中国轻工轴承之乡，专注微型深沟球轴承26年。3000㎡工厂、200+台设备、日产40万套，从加工户成长为608系列轴承源头工厂。": "Guantao Chaolei Bearing Manufacturing Co., Ltd. (Chaolei Bearings) started bearing manufacturing in 2000 as a processor; the brand entity was registered in September 2023. Rooted in Guantao, Hebei — China's light-industry bearing town — 26 years in miniature DGBB, 3,000 m² plant, 200+ machines, 400k units/day, grown into a 608-series source factory.",
